er-output .cs1-maint{color:#18911f}}</style><cite id=\"CITEREFKahney2003\" class=\"citation magazine cs1\"><a href=\"/wiki/Leander_Kahney\" title=\"Leander Kahney\">Kahney, Leander</a> (2003-09-09). <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wired.com/2003/09/grandiose-price-for-a-modest-pc/\">\"Grandiose Price for a Modest PC\"</a>. <i><a href=\"/wiki/Wired_(magazine)\" title=\"Wired (magazine)\">Wired</a></i><span class=\"reference-accessdate\">. Retrieved <span class=\"nowrap\">2019-11-04</span></span>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Wired&amp;rft.atitle=Grandiose+Price+for+a+Modest+PC&amp;rft.date=2003-09-09&amp;rft.aulast=Kahney&amp;rft.aufirst=Leander&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.wired.com%2F2003%2F09%2Fgrandiose-price-for-a-modest-pc%2F&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMicrocomputer\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite class=\"citation encyclopaedia cs1\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://dictionary.reference.com/browse/microcomputer\">\"Microcomputer\"</a>. <i>dictionary.com</i>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=bookitem&amp;rft.atitle=Microcomputer&amp;rft.btitle=dictionary.com&amp;rft&#95;id=http%3A%2F%2Fdictionary.reference.com%2Fbrowse%2Fmicrocomputer&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMicrocomputer\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFA.O.Jelinek1976\" class=\"citation journal cs1\">A.O., Williman; Jelinek, H.J. (June 1976). \"Special Tutorial: Introduction to LSI Microprocessor Developments\". <i>Computer</i>. <b>9</b> (Computer). IEEE: 37. <a href=\"/wiki/Bibcode_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bibcode (identifier)\">Bibcode</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://ui.adsabs.harvard.edu/abs/1976Compr...9f..34W\">1976Compr...9f..34W</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/Doi_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Doi (identifier)\">doi</a>:<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109%2FC-M.1976.218612\">10.1109/C-M.1976.218612</a>. <a href=\"/wiki/S2CID_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"S2CID (identifier)\">S2CID</a>&#160;<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://api.semanticscholar.org/CorpusID:11184882\">11184882</a>.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Ajournal&amp;rft.genre=article&amp;rft.jtitle=Computer&amp;rft.atitle=Special+Tutorial%3A+Introduction+to+LSI+Microprocessor+Developments&amp;rft.volume=9&amp;rft.issue=Computer&amp;rft.pages=37&amp;rft.date=1976-06&amp;rft&#95;id=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.semanticscholar.org%2FCorpusID%3A11184882%23id-name%3DS2CID&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Adoi%2F10.1109%2FC-M.1976.218612&amp;rft&#95;id=info%3Abibcode%2F1976Compr...9f..34W&amp;rft.aulast=A.O.&amp;rft.aufirst=Williman&amp;rft.au=Jelinek%2C+H.J.&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMicrocomputer\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-microvalid-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-microvalid_4-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Proof of \"micro\" as a once-common term:<br />(i) Direct reference: Graham Kibble-White, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.offthetelly.co.uk/oldott/www.offthetelly.co.uk/index7943.html?page_id=568\">\"Stand by for a Data-Blast\"</a>, Off the Telly. Article written December 2005, retrieved 2006-12-15.<br />(ii) Usage in the titles of <a href=\"/wiki/Christopher_Evans_(computer_scientist)\" title=\"Christopher Evans (computer scientist)\">Christopher Evans</a>' books <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/0340259752\">\"The Mighty Micro\"</a> (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-340-25975-2\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-340-25975-2\"><bdi>0-340-25975-2</bdi></a>) and <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/0340259752\">\"The Making of the Micro\"</a> (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-575-02913-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-575-02913-7\"><bdi>0-575-02913-7</bdi></a>). Other books include Usborne's <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.amazon.co.uk/dp/0860206378\">\"Understanding the Micro\"</a> (<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><a href=\"/wiki/ISBN_(identifier)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"ISBN (identifier)\">ISBN</a>&#160;<a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-86020-637-8\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-86020-637-8\"><bdi>0-86020-637-8</bdi></a>), a children's guide to microcomputers.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐65fsn\nCached time: 20260918181014\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Citation/CS1 (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, prevent‐selective‐update]\nCPU time usage: 0.222 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.298 seconds\nPre